<title>USA: Orbotech stake cut by Ormat.</title>
<headline>Orbotech stake cut by Ormat.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ormat Industries Ltd said Tuesday it cut its stake in Orbotech Ltd to 556,120 ordinary shares or 4.3 percent.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Ormat said its latest transactions include the sale of 147,817 shares between January 20 and February 6. No prices were given.</p>
<p>All the shares were sold in relation to rule 144 governing private transactions through Oppenheimer &amp; Co Inc.</p>
</text>
